      "name": "Beretta 93 Raffica",
      "slug": "beretta-93-raffica",
      "teaser": "Adds M93R into Tarkov",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1450.png",
      "downloads": 17878,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Introducing Beretta 93 Raffica, a 3-round burst machine pistol based off the Beretta model</p>\n<p>This weapon was requested by RaiRaiTheRaichu</p>\n<p>This mod adds M93R, the foldable angled grip (animation not yet available), a stock, a switchable firemode between single and burst, a suppressor, and 1 special item that I will not reveal.</p>\n<p>The gun can be bought from Peacekeeper LLV 1 by trading in a regular Beretta alongside $216</p>\n<p>Credit Section</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.artstation.com/marketplace/p/rAD8/auto-9-robocop-beretta-m93r-raffica\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Berretta 93R Model</a> by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://rifleman.artstation.com\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Paul Yakushev</a></p>\n<p>RaiRaiTheRaichu for providing the models<br />\nMe porting the gun to EFT</p>\n<p>P.S. Burst recoil are awful unless recoil is very low, can’t have shit in tarkov</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instructions</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Download the Zip from the Gdrive</p>\n<p>2. Open the Zip</p>\n<p>3. Copy the content of the Zip your SPT folder</p>\n<p>4. Enjoy</p></div></div></div>\n",
